    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Swiss Cottage is a unique residence occupying an elevated and private position on Compass Hill in the sought-after Dromderrig area of Kinsale. The property enjoys spectacular panoramic views over the harbour and surrounding coastline, including the historic James Fort and Charles Fort."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "The existing accommodation comprises a spacious open-plan kitchen/dining area, reception room with solid-fuel stove, conservatory, master bedroom with en-suite, two further ground-floor bathrooms/utility facilities and three additional bedrooms upstairs. Mature trees, stone walls and a private garden provide excellent seclusion, while the tarmac driveway offers ample parking. There is also a seperate self contained unit with a kitchen, living room, bedroom and bathroom.\r\n\r\nA major attraction is the full planning permission already granted for an exceptional two-storey, contemporary residence, superbly designed to maximise the property's extraordinary views. The proposed new home will provide four generous double bedrooms and a striking reverse-living layout, placing the principal living accommodation at first-floor level to fully embrace the panoramic outlook.\r\n\r\nThis is a rare opportunity to create a stunning modern home in one of Kinsale's most prestigious and scenic locations, with the benefit of full planning permission already in place."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Full planning permission granted – A significant advantage, with permission already in place for an impressive two-storey contemporary four-bedroom residence.\r\n\r\nPrestigious Kinsale location – Situated in one of Kinsale’s most sought-after and scenic settings, offering an excellent combination of privacy, views and location."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "BER Details",
        "SortOrder": 4,
        "Content": "BER: C2"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Location",
        "SortOrder": 10,
        "Content": "Swiss Cottage is a  residence occupying a spectacular elevated position on the exclusive Compass Hill Road. The property enjoys breathtaking 180° panoramic views across Kinsale Harbour and towards Arbrack.\r\n\r\nLocated just a few minutes walk from Kinsale town centre the property is close to all the amenities of this pretty seaside town and approx. 30 minutes drive from the cosmopolitan city of Cork. This area of South West Ireland is of outstanding beauty with its dramatic coastline, unspoilt locations and safe beaches.\r\n\r\nLeisure activities are well catered for, Kinsale provides excellent sailing, yachting and fishing facilities from its two marinas. There are two golf courses including the renowned Old Head of Kinsale. Other recreational pursuits include walking, bathing, surfing, and horse riding. There are numerous cultural events held throughout the year, such as the world famous Kinsale Arts Festival, Kinsale Gourmet Festival, the Cork Jazz Festival, the Cork Film Festival, along with a thriving music and opera programme.\r\n\r\nKinsale is also home to some of Ireland’s finest restaurants, contributing to its title as Gourmet Capital of Ireland. There are many top class hotels and lots of welcoming pubs.\r\n\r\nCork International Airport is conveniently located 30 minutes drive from Kinsale with direct links within Ireland and to major European and UK cities."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Disclaimer/Privacy Policy",
        "SortOrder": 10,
        "Content": "Finest International Real Estate Ireland Ltd. t/a Engel & Voelkers act as agents for the vendors or lessors of this property whose agents they are, give notice that: \r\n1. By sending an enquiry through the property portal in relation to any of our property listings you are consenting to the storage, use and processing of your personal data by the provider according to Engel & Voelkers’ privacy policy in order for us to reply to your contact request or request for information. A copy of our privacy policy can be viewed at www.engelvoelkers.com/southkerry/privacypolicy. You can revoke your consent at any time in the future in line with the privacy policy.\r\n2. The particulars are set out as a general outline for the guidance of intending purchasers or lessees, and do not institute, nor constitute part of, an offer or contract. \r\n3. All descriptions, dimensions, references to condition and necessary permissions for use and occupation, and any other details are given in good faith and are believed to be correct, but any intending purchasers or tenants should not rely on them as statements or representatives of fact but must satisfy themselves by inspection or otherwise as to the correctness of each of them. \r\n4. Any loose furniture, non-integrated appliances, white goods and curtains are deemed not to be included in the sale of the property unless specifically agreed between the parties and outlined in an inventory. Any reference to appliances refers to integrated appliances only.\r\n5. No person in the employment of Finest International Real Estate Ireland Ltd. t/a Engel & Voelkers has any authority to make or give representation or warranty in relation to this property. \r\n6. Availability upon agreement - subject to contract. This offer is subject to change of price, withdrawal or prior sale without notice. \r\n7. Transfer fees, i.e. stamp duty, solicitor fees etc, are not included in the sales price and have to be paid by the buyer. The commission will be paid by the seller."
